ing games and try out free demos. STEP THEATER is a rhythm game where you progress through stages to the beat of the music. Our free demo is already available, offering approximately 20 minutes of gameplay. If you haven't tried it yet, now is th","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-10T06:00:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067935450","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:21:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4264410-1846018067932509","game_id":"steam-4264410","kind":"announcement","title":"STEP THEATER Coming to Nintendo Switch 2 and Nintendo Switch!","summary":"We, NB Games, are honored to share an update here on the Steam Community about the platforms STEP THEATER will be available on.The game is scheduled to launch on Nintendo Switch 2, Nintendo Switch, and Steam on December 3, 2026.You can wishlist STEP THEATER on Steam now.Add it to your wishlist and stay tuned for launch!We’ll continue to share the latest STEP THEATER news and updates here on the Steam Community.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-09T08:07:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067932509","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:21:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4264410-1846018067928763","game_id":"steam-4264410","kind":"announcement","title":"STEP THEATER Launches December 3, 2026!","summary":"We’re excited to announce that STEP THEATER will launch on December 3, 2026!STEP THEATER is a music and rhythm game in which players step to the beat and advance the stories unfolding on screen.With every step, the scene, music, and required actions change. From school-life sequences to 2D action-game-inspired stages, players can enjoy a variety of “films,” each offering a different experience.We’ll be sharing more news and updates as we get closer to launch.Add STEP THEATER to your Steam Wishli","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T08:03:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067928763","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:21:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4264410":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:47:19Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:47:19Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4264410":"2026-10-26T11:47:19Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4264410":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:47:19Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T11:47:19Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:47:19Z"},"4818280":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:47:19Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T11:47:19Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:47:19Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4264410","app_id":4264410,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:31Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"1c40ef23b1943d09494b857980ad2381e70b4794694c87b3e3d06fabd8e563d0","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"WELCOME TO THE “STEP THEATER” :) \r\n“STEP THEATER” is a vibrant rhythm game where the story unfolds and the screen comes closer to success with every step you take. Dive in and enjoy this charming, vibrant drama!","publishers":[{"name":"エヌビーゲームズ"}],"developers":[{"name":"Pixel Smile"}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1798704000,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_year"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"STEPTHEATER_shortPV_en","trailer_url_forma